ican column, and prediction markets give Lee about a 93 percent chance of winning. House Democrats' campaign arm quietly removed the district from its target list over the summer, and the primary challenge Lee survived did not appear to weaken her position. The race is expected to remain firmly in Republican hands.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.0439, "margin": -10.97}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0254, "margin": -14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0439, "margin": -12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0149, "margin": -14.0}]}